        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MH12, Solid Brass Double Pronged Modern Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Double Pronged Modern Wall Hook is great for use in all rooms of the house. It is easy to install and comes with the mounting screws. This Double Pronged Solid Brass Modern Hook is available in a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MH12-specifications.gif?v=1704354662\" width=\"487\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MH12 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MH12 Coat and Hat Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MH12-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MH12 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
